* text=auto
*.js text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.min.js text eol=lf
# Vendored copies are hash-pinned (see docs/THIRD_PARTY_PORTS.md); their bytes must be the
# same in the working tree, in the blob and on any platform's checkout, or the pin only holds
# on the machine that generated it. Narrow on purpose: a blanket `vendor/** text` rule would
# corrupt any binary a later vendored asset brings in (fonts, per PLAN_JIZURA_PV.md §5).
vendor/**/*.txt text eol=lf
vendor/**/*.js text eol=lf
vendor/**/*.json text eol=lf
